# Keep the original 1.12.2 reference jar + compat helper jar OUT of source control
# (re-download via gradle / mod page if needed)
# Uncomment if you want to track them:
# CubicChunks-1.12.2-*-all.jar
# [CC]CubicChunksCompatibilityHelper-*.jar

# Immersive Portals jars — they aren't project source. The IP source under
# `ip_source/` is what downstream consumers build against; the ~5 MB of
# released jars across both upstream naming families (hyphen + underscore)
# are pulled from Modrinth / the IP releases page. One broad glob covers
# future MC versions and loader-suffix variants too; anchored to `.jar`,
# so it cannot collide with the `.java` files under `ip_source/` or any
# of the `.json` mixin configs.
**/immersive[-_]portals*.jar
